{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:\u00a0</strong>The single-player portion of <i>Eterna</i> remains fully functional and offers 100+ hours of gameplay. Sadly, as GameSparks backend support ends so certain online features will be unavailable.<br><br>Even so, <i>Eterna</i> remains a complete experience \u2014 if you enjoy deep strategic gameplay or rich storytelling, it\u2019s absolutely worth diving in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128970/extras/a4867daf86a7533105e0d26842827626.poster.avif?t=1761388133\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128970/extras/a4867daf86a7533105e0d26842827626.webm?t=1761388133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128970/extras/a4867daf86a7533105e0d26842827626.mp4?t=1761388133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An epic fantasy tale spanning decades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Eterna is in grave danger, seemingly abandoned by their creators, the mortal races bicker among themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-standing feuds between Humans and Behemoths threaten to erupt into open conflict and it falls to <strong>you</strong> to restore order to these troubled lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be Who You Want!<br>Define your features, and abilities using our in-depth character creation system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Your Weaponry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select One Of Two Distinct Character Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish A Bloodline!<br>Fight through multiple decades of Adventures, and begin a line of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Your Foes<br>Master the turn-based tactical combat system, and dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Allies and Enemies<br>Fight our join other players on their quests, and experience Eterna together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft mighty weapons of war and armaments with the aid of gods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the diverse and mysterious lands of Centura</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face horrific adversaries in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your hero and create your unique champion both mechanically and cosmetically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down monsters demons and beasts for great loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own playstyle and bent the continent to your will</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore various areas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap headfirst into the unknown and explore the diverse and exotic world of Centura: delve into the deepest dungeons or climb atop the highest mountain peaks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128970/extras/d48c7a16b6a1073749484fda0203c344.poster.avif?t=1761388133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128970/extras/d48c7a16b6a1073749484fda0203c344.webm?t=1761388133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128970/extras/d48c7a16b6a1073749484fda0203c344.mp4?t=1761388133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/007a3d5774555ecd5800bc7cbaea515dddba38fc.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/007a3d5774555ecd5800bc7cbaea515dddba38fc.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/007a3d5774555ecd5800bc7cbaea515dddba38fc.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/007a3d5774555ecd5800bc7cbaea515dddba38fc.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/007a3d5774555ecd5800bc7cbaea515dddba38fc.jpg"},{"name":"Do-Gooder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/e3326a145aee2594d03774633817c41ab85a8f74.jpg"},{"name":"Protector of the Land","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/e3326a145aee2594d03774633817c41ab85a8f74.jpg"},{"name":"Folk Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/e3326a145aee2594d03774633817c41ab85a8f74.jpg"},{"name":"Scout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/4a91e0ebec67bd5dc8f970ccd54a1998860b0d57.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1128970/4a91e0ebec67bd5dc8f970ccd54a1998860b0d57.jpg"}],"total":70},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1128970?t=1761388133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1128970?t=1761388133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761388133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama